  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Released from jail back in Sapporo, Muranishi stops into a quiet video shop and scoffs at a phony tape. Recognizing the proprietress's Fukushima dialect, he shares pickled herring and drinks with her upstairs, finding unexpected warmth and artistic inspiration. Listen to the Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "何だ、このウソくさいのは。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "出身、福島なんですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "え？どうして？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いや、方言。俺も福島です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "奇遇ねえ。ニシンのさんしょう漬け、懐かしいでしょ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "じゃあ私も同郷のよしみで一緒に頂こうかな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "それじゃ、さみしんぼうさん二人に乾杯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "こんなに飲んだの久しぶり。お酒強いのね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "旦那さん、国鉄で働いてたんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "そう。札幌駅で弁当売りやってたの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "起きてたんだね。すばらしいよ、これ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ありがとう。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "何だ、このウソくさいのは。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is this phony-looking video?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "出身、福島なんですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You're originally from Fukushima, aren't you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "え？どうして？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Huh? How did you know?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いや、方言。俺も福島です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'From your dialect. I'm from Fukushima too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "奇遇ねえ。ニシンのさんしょう漬け、懐かしいでしょ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What a coincidence! Herring pickled with pepper leaves—brings back memories, doesn't it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "じゃあ私も同郷のよしみで一緒に頂こうかな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then maybe I'll join you for a drink as a fellow hometown native.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "それじゃ、さみしんぼうさん二人に乾杯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well then, cheers to two lonely souls.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "こんなに飲んだの久しぶり。お酒強いのね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's been ages since I drank this much. You really hold your liquor well.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "旦那さん、国鉄で働いてたんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did your husband work for the national railway?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mama",
      "t": "そう。札幌駅で弁当売りやってたの。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes. He used to sell boxed lunches at Sapporo Station.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "起きてたんだね。すばらしいよ、これ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You were awake, huh? This footage is truly wonderful.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ありがとう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
